`src/components/ToolIcon.tsx`. Each SVG under those two asset directories also
carries its source in a header comment, except where noted as "no header".

Full license texts for the MIT-licensed icon sources are kept in
`third_party/licenses/`:

- `lobe-icons-MIT.txt` — lobehub/lobe-icons, MIT, Copyright (c) 2023 LobeHub
- `opencode-MIT.txt` — anomalyco/opencode, MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 opencode

Icons from lobehub/lobe-icons (https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons, MIT,
Copyright (c) 2023 LobeHub), package @lobehub/icons-static-svg:

- `src/assets/logos/doubao.svg` (icons/doubao-color.svg, v1.95.1). This is a
  third-party redraw, not an asset published by the trademark owner.
- `src/assets/providers/*.svg` — all 15 files; each header comment names its
  lobe-icons file (bailian, groq, hunyuan, longcat, mistral, modelscope,
  opencode, openrouter, qianfan, siliconflow, stepfun, volcengine, xai,
  xiaomi-mimo, zai)
- Codex mark inline in `ToolIcon.tsx` (`CodexMark`, path identical to lobe-icons
  icons/codex.svg)

Existing model-brand SVGs in `src/assets/logos/` (no header): `claude.svg`,
`gemini.svg`, `deepseek.svg`, `kimi.svg` (legacy provider asset), `minimax.svg`, `zhipu.svg`,
`chatglm.svg`, `openai.svg`, `codex.svg`. Their markup has the lobe-icons static
SVG shape (`<title>`, `height="1em"`, `flex:none`); `claude.svg`, `deepseek.svg`
and `zhipu.svg` are byte-identical (ignoring line breaks) to lobe-icons v1.95.1
`claude-color.svg`, `deepseek-color.svg` and `zhipu-color.svg`; the others differ
from v1.95.1 (older release or locally recolored). Provenance is therefore
inferred as lobe-icons (MIT), exact source and version 来源待核.

Obsidian: the original gradient mark is used unchanged to identify the supported
application. The mark remains the owner's trademark; this project grants no
rights to reuse it. Brand guidelines: https://obsidian.md/brand.

